weakspot.guide.16.title=Ladders
weakspot.guide.16.text=While climbing up or down a ladder or vine, a brown weak spot appears straight above or below your crosshair. Aim at it to climb faster; the longer your combo, the faster you go.
weakspot.guide.17.title=Elytra
weakspot.guide.17.text=While gliding with an elytra, a blue weak spot appears near your crosshair. Aim at it to dash toward where you look; the longer your combo, the harder you dash. Mind the walls.
weakspot.guide.18.title=Enchanting
weakspot.guide.18.text=Put an item in an enchanting table and a purple marker appears around the screen. Click it to reroll the three offers. It costs no lapis and no experience.
weakspot.guide.19.title=Harvest
weakspot.guide.19.text=Hold right-click on a ripe crop with an empty hand and a pink weak spot appears. Hit it to harvest and replant; it turns right back into a growth weak spot. The longer your combo, the bigger the harvest.
weakspot.guide.20.title=Throwing
weakspot.guide.20.text=Hold an ender pearl, snowball or other throwable and a teal weak spot appears near your crosshair. Each hit charges the gauge, and your next throw flies faster and farther. Switching items clears the charge.
weakspot.guide.21.title=Sprinting
weakspot.guide.21.text=While sprinting, a red weak spot appears straight above or below your crosshair. Aim at it to run faster; the longer your combo, the faster you go.
